{"server":"tw","storyId":"act13side_level_act13side_08_end","groupId":"act13side","stageId":"act13side_08","title":"最後的怯薛","storyCode":"NL-8","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"e6de189e3b806df34163e1915c02690c7679b1f11bbad2e7bedf829f85a4400f","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"卡西米尔2 8-2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"別勉強自己了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，弗格瓦爾德師傅......你的手也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"也不是第一次了，習慣了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......勝負已分。你們的實力已在意料之外，勉強能平息我的怒意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"看在末裔的份上，我不會取你性命。但現在，從我的道路上滾開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是鐵了心要和瑪嘉烈私鬥了，哈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......錯了，只是繼續一場被中斷的決鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"圖什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"你這麼偏執，這麼......瘋狂，你到底為了尋找什麼？你想要得到什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"你不明白......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"鬼明白。為了那個所謂的傳統，你放棄了生活和眼前的一切！你做的事都毫無意義！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"我生命的意義，需要你來賦予嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是不想看著你這樣瘋狂下去，“天途”只是極少數部族的成年禮傳統吧，那你也只是個孩子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......！少廢話，讓開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"那就把我打趴下再說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"——別後悔，老傢伙！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪莉婭，你做什麼！你本來就受傷——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......這還是，第一次看見你有這麼大情緒波動啊，夢魘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"騎士的盾，應當保護他人，這是姐姐告訴我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......你說我的信念是借來的，我無話可說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"可如果行那些被照亮的道路也算怯懦，那騎士就根本毫無意義！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"你妄言騎士——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"——不好意思，我現在根本不是騎士，我只單純地想保護姐姐——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"不想讓你這種說不通道理的瘋子阻礙姐姐的道路！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......法術？這又算得了......嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"瑪莉婭臉上的血液被光芒照亮。\n脆弱，微小，是的，如果全力以赴，夢魘有十足的把握殺死這匹天馬。\n他十分確信。\n但為何......此刻少女臉頰上的鮮血，如同黃金？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......法術的光芒讓血液看上去好像變成了金色？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"可已經值得被載入史冊的天馬，又怎麼會是這麼弱小的......偶然嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"弗格瓦爾德師傅，你先回去......這裡有我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"別逞強了，他真的會殺了你的——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"我會擋住他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃？你轉身是什麼意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......天馬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"你只靠他人信念，是無法強大的，除非你真正堅信那個信念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"但你，並不相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"奉獻，犧牲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"你先天地......有著這種近乎自毀的美德。不失為給我的一次教訓，天馬，末裔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"也許......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，沒什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"替我轉告耀騎士，我與她的決鬥未了，只是暫時擱置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"也許？也許什麼？\n也許我生長在你的環境裡，我也會做出一樣的選擇？\n別這麼軟弱，拓拉。\n別這麼軟弱！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G09"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......耀騎士，血騎士，眨眼間，特錦賽也進入白熱化的階段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照積分推算的話，耀騎士已經對決賽唾手可得了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您，不感到喜悅嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"商業聯合會要是願意乖乖看著臨光奪冠就好了。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您說的是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，就算聯合會有什麼陰謀，我相信監正會和博士您，也會幫臨光渡過難關的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過，問題真的只在商業聯合會身上嗎......他們擅長的絕非親自動手，而是播下種子......靜待發芽。"}]},{"label":"經歷了感染者事件，民眾還能接受嗎？","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......會有很多抗議的聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘻......但血騎士那時，難道不也是如此嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可真當血騎士捧起獎盃，歡呼聲和鈔票淹沒了大眾的視野後，誰還會記得呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家的記憶是很短暫的，博士，無論誰贏了，接下來他們只要代表“感染者”發聲，事情就會迎刃而解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡西米爾歡迎冠軍。"}]},{"label":"臨光小姐最大的挑戰才剛剛開始。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的意思是......血騎士嗎？不，您不會說這麼膚淺的話......"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但無論怎樣，我願意相信您和臨光小姐能攻克難關。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭和各位醫療幹員還好嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，今天也在有條不紊地對感染者騎士進行檢查和醫治。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島出色的效率有目共睹，我可以理解為何大騎士長願意對你們如此信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過......明明我就在您身邊，您倒是不願意關心一下我呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可讓人有些傷心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"確實該感謝礫小姐對我們的幫助。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝......具體是要感謝什麼呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"感謝礫小姐盡職的護衛。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是職責所在，既然接到了命令，那麼我就算粉身碎骨，也在所不辭。"}]},{"label":"感謝礫小姐為束手束腳的我們提供了難能可貴的情報。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我能說的，其實都是大騎士長閣下願意讓我說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然很想坦然接受博士您的道謝，不過，真正幫助羅德島的，是那位閣下才是。"}]},{"label":"呃，感謝礫小姐陪我聊天打發時間？","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀......原來我們的交談，在您看來不過是閒聊而已？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，如果真是這樣的話，我倒是可以繼續陪您一直閒聊下去。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，博士打算怎麼感謝我呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"假借外出讓您去購物街放個假？","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘻......好啊，其實我一直夢想著當一次模特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總是一身盔甲，我也是個女孩子哦？已經讓人厭煩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過......過去的我，很少有思考這些事情的權利。"}]},{"label":"您有什麼喜好嗎？羅德島可什麼人才都有。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喜好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很少考慮喜好問題......普通的卡西米爾姑娘都會喜歡什麼？美食？化妝品？啊......騎士話題就算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過......服裝的話......我倒是覺得，總是一身盔甲，讓人有些提不起勁來著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖說我這樣的征戰騎士，穿私服的機會很少就是。"}]},{"label":"悉聽尊便。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......您知道您在說什麼嗎？“悉聽尊便”在我看來，可是受到拷問時最不該說的話哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大部分人也許是嫌麻煩才會把選擇權交給對方......不過有時候......對方會做出一些出乎預料的舉動也說不定。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼博士......能麻煩您往後坐坐嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"呃，好的。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閉上眼？我不想讓博士的眼睛受傷......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"接下來......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士，請不要睜眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果您看見了無胄盟殺手的模樣，那恐怕您別想安然離開卡西米爾了喔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"風險可不能讓你一個人承擔。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我總得知道發生了什麼吧？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你，不是普通的征戰騎士吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可沒有只允許無胄盟當刺殺者的道理啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別亂動，亂動我就割開你的喉嚨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那可不行，哪怕付出性命，我也不能讓你威脅到博士的安危。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是一家境外企業罷了......值得你一個騎士付出性命嗎——唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你胳膊上的標記......被買來的奴隸，有必要這麼忠心地對待一個外人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很遺憾，我現在是發自真心地想要保護博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G09"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......原來如此，監正會安排了你這樣一個跟班跟著羅德島，從一開始就打算借羅德島的手調查零號地塊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別把我們的關係說得像是在利用一樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"沒錯，要說的話應該是“互相利用”。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......或者叫雙贏。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"總之相處愉快就行了，不是嗎？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......你就是，羅德島的“博士”嗎，你身邊應該還有一個卡特斯小女孩......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"我不喜歡對孩子下手，解決你就可以了吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"很遺憾，阿米婭才是羅德島的領導人。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"以及，小看阿米婭是不行的。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，您先走，這裡有我攔著，帶著阿米婭小姐離開這裡，去找監正會的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......我可不是一個人來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"無胄盟已經秘密包圍了這裡......現在你們插翅難飛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒關係的，博士，只要有我在，我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——博士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......反過來擋在護衛的身前，是什麼意思，你要以自己的性命來保護其他人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"真是令人感動......但我也是有任務在身的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"常務董事給你的任務嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"如果我沒猜錯，董事會沒有給你下達直接命令。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道你在說什麼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"梅什科工業？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"太陽草製藥集團？","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"還是雲端藥業？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"當然，羅德島威脅到了他們。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"但是一家境外企業，得知真相又如何？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"可我相信，他們有能力抹消羅德島的聲音。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"他們真正害怕的，是在同一張桌子上，盯著他們的餓獸。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"他們害怕的，是自己人。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......所以呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"看上去，你要殺我，易如反掌，對吧？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你急著動手嗎？還是說你的工作時間是彈性制的？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那不如坐下來喘口氣吧。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......你真的明白你在做什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"就算有這個征戰騎士攔著，我也能——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不，你不能。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"昨天，發言人親眼見證了羅德島與合作方簽訂合約。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"馬克維茨可幫了不少忙。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"你想知道羅德島現在於“法律上”的名義嗎？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"現在羅德島製藥是商業聯合會臨時加盟組織。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"對我們出手，即是對聯合會出手。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"而且無論如何，我相信總有人不會放過這個機會。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你們當然有繞過“法律”的本事。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"但是你們繞不過文明的表象之下，貪婪的自相殘殺。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"電話......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"請去吧，您是......白金大位來著？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"找你的。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"聽聽文明的聲音吧，小姐。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電話那頭的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......欣特萊雅嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電話那頭的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"用不著吃驚，白金大位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電話那頭的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我該慶幸，你還沒有對羅德島的領導人下殺手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電話那頭的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"收隊吧，命令傳達有誤。那些急於求成的蠢貨竟敢繞過董事會對無胄盟下命令......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電話那頭的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也讓零號地塊停止對“無用感染者”的處理。羅德島讓我們明白，這些人還有價值......還能創造價值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電話那頭的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就這樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......你......你算計好的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"你是怎麼做到......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"拉攏一些人，對付另一些人。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這並不是什麼難事。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"只是大部分人，甚至主動找到自己的老闆提出想法都很困難。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"真正的難點在，判斷拉攏哪些人，對付哪些人。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"在這件事上，所幸我還有一位能說得通的友人。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G03"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那零號地塊怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在感染者引發了這麼多暴動之後，任由兩個感染者騎士大放異彩，不確定因素太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是這個時間點，零號地塊處理感染者的事情被曝光......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人馬克維茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許有好有壞......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不允許“有好有壞”。無論是好還是壞，我們要求的是“盡在掌握”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人馬克維茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我有別的辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人馬克維茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以防萬一，我已經讓無胄盟去做了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G09"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......我該就這麼放過你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"身為外人，你已經得知了無胄盟的存在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......別這麼糾纏不清，很難看喔？白金大位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士！關於今天的物資輸送——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"唔？博士有新的客人？抱、抱歉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒關係的，請進吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然讓無胄盟和征戰騎士坐在一起喝茶，博士，你還真是讓人意想不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......那，博士，過來一下，這份文件要你也簽字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"（那就是羅德島的領導人......如果是現在動手的話......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"只是想像而已。\n連近在咫尺的礫都沒有察覺到任何殺氣，當然，畢竟只是想像而已。\n可就算如此，白金還是突然猶豫了，隨後，她感到慶幸。\n慶幸自己沒有一根筋地把任務進行到底。\n她轉瞬之間從那隻嬌小的卡特斯身上預感到了一種可能性。\n動手的話，自己真的能安然無恙地拔出箭矢嗎？\n還是在那之前——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......？小姐？怎麼了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"不，失禮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才打碎的玻璃，我會讓人補上，今天，我就先回了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島的......{@nickname}博士，是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"我記住你了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士，礫小姐，剛才發生了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一起喝了杯茶而已。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G07"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"......白金大位，這是您要的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"真虧你們能找到啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"是。我們檢索了羅德島與監正會的通訊頻段，以此為線索定位到了這些資訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是幹員臨光，也就是耀騎士真實的體檢報告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......耀騎士......不是感染者？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G08"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎來到卡西米爾特錦賽現場！我是你們的老朋友大嘴莫布！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"多虧了逐魘騎士的失誤，我們才有幸觀賞到今天的比賽！血騎士對陣逐魘騎士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"無與倫比的恐怖與實力！強大的血騎士與傳說中的夢魘究竟會碰擦出怎樣的火花！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"在先前的比賽中，血騎士就與逐魘騎士有了一次充滿火藥味的會面！現如今！雙方正式站在了賽場上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"廝殺！戰鬥！唯有勝利者方能光榮！讓我們歡迎——兩位騎士——入場——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒有騎士團所屬，沒有贊助商贊助，天啊，你們為什麼要放過這麼大一塊餡餅！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"誰來為他創造一個騎士團！一定能賺大錢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"另一面是，鮮血之王，卡西米爾的血色高腳杯，無情的制勝機器，當之無愧的巔峰！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"血——騎士！狄開俄波利斯！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......又見面了，夢魘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還在追尋過去的影子嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_204_platnm","aliases":["白金"]}]}
